{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "health-i18n-collection-001",
		"name": "Health & I18n Controllers",
		"description": "Collection para testar os endpoints dos controllers HealthController e I18nController.\n\n**HealthController:**\n- Verificação de saúde da aplicação\n- Status do serviço\n\n**I18nController:**\n- Mensagens traduzidas\n- Idiomas suportados\n- Testes de internacionalização\n- Demonstração de comportamento I18N\n\n**Idiomas Suportados:**\n- English (padrão)\n- Português (pt)\n- Español (es)\n- Italiano (it)\n\n**Como usar:**\n1. Selecione o environment 'SSE Demo - Local Development'\n2. Execute os requests na ordem sugerida\n3. Para testar diferentes idiomas, use o parâmetro ?lang=pt|es|it",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health Controller",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check - English (Default)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has correct structure\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('status');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('timestamp');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('service');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('version');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('locale');",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Service status is UP\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('UP');",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Default locale is English\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.locale).to.include('en');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{apiUrl}}/health",
							"host": [
								"{{apiUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"health"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
